Sample a local log drain and review its data contract.

Usage: drain-check <COMMAND>

Commands:
  listen      Receive a bounded local sample. Bodies are aggregated and then discarded
  inspect     Analyse newline-delimited JSON from a file without opening a listener
  demo        Run the sample embedded in this binary in a new temporary directory
  forwarding  Print a forwarding configuration template
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
